      "id": "claim_e78fe152f306474d9e2ed391c5e0dcc8",
      "statement": "writeQuestion writes the done event only after the question iterable ends of its own accord, so a client that observes done is looking at a question the interview has already stored on disk; an abandoned stream and a failed production both end without done.",
