    {
      "id": "claim_80ffc171adb3472a99cdc50a22e08442",
      "statement": "Client abandonment reaches the app as a cancelled response body, not a cancelled request: Node's adapter closes the writable side on disconnect, which cancels the body reader; writeQuestion checks stream.aborted before every frame and the route's onAbort handler aborts the AbortSignal passed to openingQuestion.",
